ardless of how old  Peter Parker is Venom is still going to  be happening in Spider-Man 4 but this  still could happen if he is an adult and  keep in mind if he is an adult he'll  probably still be a relatively young  adult maybe 30 years old but I for one  do think it would be really really cool  like Kevin feige to see Peter Parker out  of school I think it would be a really  great change now speaking of changes  Spider-Man knowing home changed every  everything when they introduce the other  two Spider-Man in the same universe  interacting with r Peter Parker it was  an iconic moment one of the greatest  moments not only in superhero history  but of course in film history as well  and it looks like the three Spider-Man  may not be done it looks like Andrew  Garfield and Toby Maguire still could  come back and do another team up film  with Tom Holland Spider-Man now here's  something really important to note the  MCU has kind of contradicted itself with  phase four but that actually ended up  kind of being a good thing as far as  Spider-Man is concerned Loki established  that at the very end of the series  killing he who remains is why  essentially we have a Multiverse and not  just one timeline now and he who remains  basically said that if they kill him  then his other variants are going to  want to dominate the entire Multiverse  they will leave their universe and go  into other universes and start a  multiversal war also incursion will  probably happen that's what Miss minutes  meant when she said that the whole  entire Multiverse was almost destroyed  at the end of the multiversal war  however the villain and Spider-Man no  way home and the other Spider-Man  appeared in that Universe the Earth 616  Universe because apparently of Doctor  Strange's spell then in Doctor Strange  in the Multiverse of Madness we were  expecting some mention of Loki and he  remains and essentially the creation of  the Multiverse but that didn't happen in  fact the events of Spider-